@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About Our Heritage | Our Dried Fish®</PageTitle>

<div class="pt-12 pb-8">
    <div class="site-container">
        <!-- Page Title matching Desktop-2.png -->
        <h1 class="page-title">ABOUT</h1>

        <!-- Our Story Section -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-6 md:gap-10 mb-16">
            <div class="pt-1.5">
                <span class="section-label">OUR STORY</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col max-w-[860px]">
                <!-- Founder Spotlight -->
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start gap-6 mb-10">
                    <div class="w-full sm:w-[280px] h-[320px] sm:h-[350px] rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden bg-neutral-200 shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] flex-shrink-0">
                        <img src="images/owner-lily-smith.png" alt="Lily Smith, founder of Our Dried Fish" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-[20px]" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-3">
                        <h2 class="font-heading text-base font-black tracking-wider text-[#111111] mb-1">LILY SMITH</h2>
                        <span class="text-[13px] text-neutral-500 font-semibold">Owner & Founder</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Foundation Dedication Headline -->
                <h2 class="font-heading text-[clamp(26px,3.5vw,40px)] font-black leading-[1.18] tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#111111] mb-10">
                    Our Dried Fish was founded in honor of Lily Smith’s loving aunts, Teresa and Beth.
                </h2>

                <!-- 3-Image Showcase Row matching Desktop-2.png -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-10">
                    <div class="group aspect-[1/1.1] rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] bg-neutral-50">
                        <img src="images/products/fish-tocino.png" alt="Fish tocino sweet cured fillets" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-[20px] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="group aspect-[1/1.1] rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] bg-neutral-50">
                        <img src="images/products/dried-katambak.png" alt="Artisanal dried katambak whitefish" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-[20px] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="group aspect-[1/1.1] rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] bg-neutral-50">
                        <img src="images/products/dried-flounder.png" alt="Delicate cured dried flounder flatfish" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-[20px] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" />
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Narrative Body Text -->
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-800 mb-12">
                    <p>
                        Lily's journey with dried fish began in the heart of Cebu, Hagnaya, amidst the flourishing waters of her aunts' coastal fish racks. It was there, surrounded by the abundance of nature and the gentle salt breeze, that she discovered her passion for dried fish. From learning the names and characteristics of each coastal fish to understanding the delicate balance of solar curing and sea salinity, she absorbed the artistry of drying fish like the rich Philippine sea.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Our Dried Fish is the expression of that lifelong passion—a place where her love for dried fish translates into beautifully curated dishes, pure natural preparations, and selections that bring timeless joy and authentic flavor to your table.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Wide Breakfast Platter Banner matching Desktop-2.png -->
                <div class="w-full h-[280px] md:h-[440px] rounded-[26px] overflow-hidden mb-12 shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]">
                    <img src="images/service-native-delicacies.png" alt="Philippine breakfast platter with dried fish, garlic rice, fried eggs, and spicy vinegar dip" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-[26px]" loading="lazy" />
                </div>

                <!-- Closing Narrative & Consultation Action -->
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-800 mb-8">
                    <p>
                        From humble beginnings, Our Dried Fish has grown into a beloved local destination, known for its flavorful dried fish, personal service, and commitment to quality.
                    </p>
                    <p class="font-bold text-[#111111] mb-4">
                        Discover how we can add a touch of natural flavor to your next meal.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex">
                        <a href="/contact" class="btn-pill">BOOK A CONSULTATION</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
